## Original Content
See how we made AI agents easy to build, run, and improve in production.

## Summary
Duolingo has developed an agent platform designed to streamline the creation, operation, and enhancement of AI agents in production settings. The platform aims to make AI agents the default by simplifying their lifecycle management and improving scalability. This approach enhances operational efficiency for building and maintaining intelligent systems.

## Key Points
- Duolingo implemented a dedicated agent platform for production-ready AI agents.
- The platform simplifies the build, run, and improvement processes for AI agents.
- Aims to make AI agents the default choice in Duolingo's operations.
- Focuses on ease of use, scalability, and continuous improvement in production environments.


